WEBVTT

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.010
Stop spoiling him!

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.320
Hm? Rin-chan?

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.800
Shh. Don't be too loud.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.130
Hm?

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.500
Okiku, it's almost close to lunch,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.290
and you're not waking him up?

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.090
We just went on summer break. 
Why are you letting him do that?!

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.550
It's summer break, Rin-chan.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.460
I'm going to let him go 
to sleep when he wants,

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.580
and wake up and eat when he wants.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.690
You're just going to make Souta lazy!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.110
You need to make sure he 
gets up at a decent—

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.510
Oh, Souta. Hey.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.900
You're getting up, I see!

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:59.520
Let's all have a popsicle 
laying here together, Rin-kun.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.770
Here you go, Sou-kun.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.170
Souta!

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:10.570
Sheesh. I thought you were 
more together than that.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:13.970
I haven't been to Okiku-nee's 
house in a while,

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:15.470
so I guess I just felt like relaxing.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:19.050
I-I guess it's kind of cute to see you

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.890
all defenseless like that.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.270
Everyone from Quest Dorm is headed back home.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:27.480
It's better to have him 
here than be all alone.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.890
I thought Mei would still be there,

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.900
but Kurumiko had her go back home with her.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:37.140
She acts all tough, but Kurumiko 
manages to get to her.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.890
Now that you mention it,

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.760
Mei seems to have gotten friendlier lately.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.690
<i>Mei only lost her memories about</i>

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.300
<i>flags and the Council of the Seven Virtues.</i>

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.900
I wonder if there's some hidden 
meaning in all of this.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.840
Wh-What was that?!

00:01:58.810 --> 00:01:59.700
Ruri?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.100
Please excuse my entrance.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:04.130
Your entrance...

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.940
There is something that needs to 
be done before I'm overhauled.

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.130
Make sure you don't bite your tongue.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.290
Yes or no?

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:10.850
Huh?

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:13.350
Wait—

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:30.340
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.000
<b>Flag 8</b>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.000
<b>I'll Catch up to You. Have I Ever Broken a Promise to You Before?</b>

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.520
Okay, we've arrived.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.850
I thought my death flag had activated...

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.340
Souta-kun?!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.270
Akane?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.250
That means we're...

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:17.300
Sorry, when I said I missed you,

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.690
Ruri-chan flew off, and...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.110
Oh, right.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.170
She really did fly off. With jets.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.670
I was surprised.

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:26.280
Hm?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:30.420
Anyway, I'm going to 
return to my maintenance.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.240
I'd forgotten just how upper-class you are.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.680
I don't want you to think I live 
in a different world than you!

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.380
I'm Akane-san, the Crawling Chaos, 
who's always by your side!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:45.920
Uh...

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.530
Akane.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.680
Y-Yes?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.850
You'll always be you.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:54.600
Hm?

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.310
Souta-kun...

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.790
You're a kind girl, who 
looks great when she smiles.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.650
That's how I see you.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.270
Not in a different world, or anything.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.570
Really?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.780
Yeah.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.900
My heart will always be with yours.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.140
As along as you need me.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.340
It sounds like you're proposing to me!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.450
I just don't know!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.160
I mean, not that I don't know.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.980
It's that I'd just feel bad about Rin-chan-senpai,

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:30.330
and Mei-chan, and Megu-chan.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.580
Anyway, why don't you relax?

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.850
There was a name in that list 
that shouldn't have been there, either.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:38.300
A-Anyway, I'd feel bad for the others,

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.440
so I'm not going to do something 
with you without them.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.650
Oh, yeah, I just left Rin-kun 
and Okiku-nee there.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.570
<b>He contacts them</b>

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:49.870
Huh?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.280
Sou-kun! Souta!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:52.300
Huh?

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:53.770
Okiku-nee?

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:54.790
You're all here.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.240
Sou-kun!

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:59.870
What are you doing getting 
kidnapped without my permission?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.310
Yeah, don't worry us.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.340
Souta-kun went up to the stars!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.920
Nothing even happened...

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.280
I shouldn't have worried—

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.290
I wasn't worried at all.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.930
Mei-oneechan was worried most 
of all, until a second ago.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.600
N-No, I wasn't!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.930
Why are Megumu and the others here, too?

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:20.900
Oh, that's because Okiku was

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.780
worried and called everyone, crying.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.610
This is just getting crazier...

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.160
Sorry for all the trouble...

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.150
Ruri likes to cause trouble.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:37.530
But I'm happy you missed Sou-kun while

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.790
we were on break.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:42.090
Yeah, it was all like we all left,

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:44.170
and now we're back together.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.710
It's like we're cursed.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.650
Why are you laughing, Kurumiko?

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.720
No reason!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.210
I guess Akane-oneechan

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.450
really does have a lot of money.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.330
But you don't act stuck up,

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.250
and you're nice to me and Onii-chan...

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:05.480
That makes me happy.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.990
Kurumiko-chan...

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.870
I'm glad to have all of you over today!

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.390
I want all of you to have lots of fun!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.290
H-How do you eat this, Onii-chan?!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.270
I'm not well versed in 
table manners, either...

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.160
I guess we should just copy Akane.

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.700
That's a great idea!

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:43.300
<i>Everyone seems to be staring at me...</i>

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.340
U-Uh...

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.900
Could you give Souta-kun

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:57.380
a little extra roast beef?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.580
Please cut a lot of roast beef for Sou-kun!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.120
Please give Souta a lot of roast beef.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.710
I want Souta-kun to have tons of roast beef!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:11.220
Give Onii-chan an extra 
helping of roast beef!

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.260
I love roast beef.

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.830
What are you guys doing...

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.350
It's amazing they have an 
outdoor bath like this.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.170
Hm? Megumu?

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:42.320
It's the first time you've 
gotten in the bath with—

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.500
Huh?

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.360
Rin-kun?!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.260
S-S-Souta?!

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.740
Why are you in the women's bath?!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.010
You pervert! Jerk! Voyeur!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.870
Th-This is the men's bath, Rin-kun!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:55.920
What are you saying?!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.300
This is women's bath!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.410
Akane and the others?!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.770
That must mean this is the women's bath...

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.440
Over this way, Souta!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:13.080
It's nice to have a bath outdoors like this.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.450
I wish I could have called Granny.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.590
Our bath here is good for the skin,

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.440
but I don't think it helps a bad hip.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.680
It helps your skin?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:26.360
They've got a pool, too!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.520
Y-You saved me, Rin-kun.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.590
Rin-kun?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.230
Souta saw me...

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:35.550
Saw me naked...

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:38.290
I can't get married now.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.430
Uh...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.080
I guess if no one else marries you,

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.430
I'll marry you.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.700
What are you saying?!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.450
You... bath and...

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.570
Rin-kun, calm down.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.090
Hm? Rin-chan-senpai, you're here already?

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.440
Oh, yeah.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.820
Why are you splashing about?

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.450
I-It's such a nice bath,

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.580
I forgot myself and started 
playing around like a little kid.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.540
Rin-oneechan sometimes acts like a kid—

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.320
it's really cute.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.370
Y-Yeah?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.160
Mei-oneechan is the same way.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.840
Why me?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.840
But I'm glad you

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.200
didn't get in the bath earlier.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.590
What do you mean?

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.830
The bath here at the house has 
set hours for men and women.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:28.800
I forgot to tell Rin-chan-senpai 
and Souta-kun.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.470
Silly me.

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.110
Don't forget something like that!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.260
S-Sorry.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.060
Huh?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.910
I-I...

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:40.690
Don't worry about it.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.120
What's wrong?

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.470
<i>Hey.</i>

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:54.920
Oh, Akane?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.300
<i>Nanami-chan!</i>

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.920
<i>Thanks for calling me.</i>

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:01.550
I-I guess you're lonely, too—

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.120
I mean bored.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.330
I guess I'll just have 
to talk to you for a bit.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.770
<i>It's Nanami-chan!</i>

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.600
<i>Are you doing well?</i>

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:10.900
<i>Nanami-chan!</i>

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.540
<i>Onii-chan, it's Nanami-oneechan.</i>

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.240
What?

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.410
<i>Oh, Nanami.</i>

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.400
Wh-Wh-Wh—

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.340
<i>Why are you guys all at Akane's house?!</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.980
We're all sleeping over.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:22.760
<i>What?!</i>

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.950
Onii-chan, Akane-oneechan, hurry.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.390
Oh, right!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:28.600
Here I go!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.570
Take this!

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:30.890
Souta-kun, save me!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.670
Don't use me as a shield!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.000
Hang in there, Hatate Souta!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.620
Now you've done it!

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.320
It's time for me to use

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.070
my Souta-kun pillow to win the day!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.160
When did you make that?!

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:50.490
You guys suck! Suck!

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:54.760
<i>Sorry you don't get to join the fun.</i>

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:57.980
<i>I'll have a pillow fight with you.</i>

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.940
How am I supposed to do that?!

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.500
Out of battery?!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.320
Nanami-chan!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.310
Hey, everyone.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.180
Thanks for coming such a long distance.

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:37.360
As promised, we've come to 
have a pillow fight with you.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.550
Why are you having a pillow fight here?!

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.740
She got mad at me for some reason...

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.050
Jeez...

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.710
Well...

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.600
Welcome to the Principality of Bladefield.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.590
Anyway, I'm sure you're 
all tired from the trip.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.970
We'll be on a train for three hours.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:08.260
We're going to the capital, Twin Blades.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.050
This is going to be fun!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.860
I was supposed to spend summer 
break alone at the dorm...

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.830
This is a nice and peaceful country.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.220
Yeah, our country—

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.940
This country produces 
wine and dairy products,

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.780
so you'll be seeing a lot 
of nature and pastures.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:45.400
You know a lot about this country, Mei-chan.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.880
Oh, yeah...

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.470
I wonder why.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.020
<i>Mei...</i>

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.980
Souta-kun, you're not saying much.

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:56.060
I bet you're hungry.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.900
I thought this might happen, 
so I brought some snacks.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.810
R-Ruri?

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:08.080
Portable Frame, Type-L4,

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.200
Nendoro Ruri.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.430
Please call me Ruri.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.080
That's the same name!

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:16.830
S-S-S-So cute!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:21.720
Actually, what's on your head, Ruri?

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.380
That's my bra!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:28.680
<i>Big.</i>

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.450
<i>Really big.</i>

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>Big.</i>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:30.840
<i>Super big.</i>

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.080
<i>Totally big.</i>

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.960
<i>So big.</i>

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.680
<b>Big</b>

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.680
<i>Big...</i>

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.330
Where's the car, again...

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.530
Oh, sorry.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.270
Given that you're on this train,

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.030
I assume you're somehow 
related to the royal family, I assume?

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:12.640
Huh?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.770
I would guess that he is a classmate 
of the 13th crown princess,

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.940
Princess Nanami, 
currently studying abroad in Japan.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.940
Oh, so you're Japanese?

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:25.200
Are you a haniwa, 
a Japanese funeral doll, are you?

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.320
What? A haniwa?

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:29.110
Are you a ninja, then, are you?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.910
No...

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:32.470
I'm not a ninja.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.870
I have a friend named Ninjabayashi, though.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.760
How wonderful!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.250
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:50.340
I'm the 14th crown princess of 
the Principality of Bladefield,

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:55.680
Hakua Berserker Bladefield.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.180
Nice to meet you.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.060
Hakua...

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.440
Oh, my name is Hatate Souta.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:05.210
Hatate Souta-san...

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.540
Pretty much like a haniwa, pretty much!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.230
Only the "ha" is the same!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:13.610
You're a lot of fun, you are.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.240
No, I think you're

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.370
far more interesting than I.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:23.850
Could you please tell me 
about Japan, could you?

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:28.030
So in Japan,

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:31.470
men and women go to the same school, do they?

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.480
I guess this country is different.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:36.570
I've never been, so I don't know, I don't.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.230
Then why were you surprised?

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:41.000
I've been learning at a girls-only

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.310
nunnery since I was small, I have.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.860
I guess you've been really sheltered, 
compared to Nanami.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.190
Actually, just like Nanami, 
you have a Japanese-ish name.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.340
Yes, my mother's Japanese, so...

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.320
I believe that the

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.140
13th crown princess's mother is, as well, I do.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:01.620
So does that mean that you and 
Nanami have different mothers?

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.100
Oh, sorry.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.100
I shouldn't have just asked 
that out of the blue.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.490
Is it not normal to be siblings,

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:09.630
but be born to different mothers, is it not?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.460
Oh, I see.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:14.210
I guess polygamy is normal for royalty...

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.710
So, how old are you, Hakua?

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.100
I'll be 16 this year.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.220
So you're the same age as Nanami and me...

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:26.300
Oh, you asked how old I was because Japan 
bases their social structure off of age,

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:29.690
and you wanted to see if 
I was inferior to you, didn't you?

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:29.690
No!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.570
What are you doing?

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:37.630
N-Nanami! Why are you here?

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.580
I thought this might happen,

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:43.290
so I put a transmitter in your body. Ahem.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.640
What did you do to me...

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:49.250
You didn't come back, so I came 
to see what was going on, and...

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:54.190
Allow me to extend my greetings 
to you, 13th crown princess.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.070
I extend my apologies for my companion's intrusion,

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.510
14th crown princess.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:00.510
You're sure formal to each other for sisters.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.140
I've actually only met her a few times.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:08.630
Also, unlike me, the 14th crown 
princess is the youngest of us.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:11.820
She was completely spoiled by His Majesty.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:15.010
<i>His Majesty? Her father?</i>

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.030
Anyway...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:19.410
Why are you talking being so friendly 
with the 14th crown princess?!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.120
Akane and the others were

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:23.250
You are in the presence of the princesses.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.910
worried sick that you hadn't returned!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:23.910
Please return—

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.170
Eliminate Princess Nanami and Princess Hakua.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:28.620
An attack!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.330
Princess, please run!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:31.460
That's...!

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:40.050
I will complete my mission.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:50.980
Hakua!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.030
Go now!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.070
Over here, Souta!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:00.670
Nanami!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.110
What's up with her?

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.420
Isn't that Ruri?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.580
My main body is undergoing maintenance.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.340
She's probably a mass-produced 
unit that was exported to Europe.

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:24.110
I believe she's been customized 
to be an assassin.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.440
She may be a mass-produced unit, 
but she is my sister.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.940
I will take responsibility 
as her older sister.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.480
Stop it, Ruri!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:36.650
Huh?

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:40.100
Run away!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.120
I figured this'd happen!

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:46.790
This is...

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.710
It's the last car, Souta!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:51.940
I know!

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.510
What should we do...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.150
<i>This is the same as...</i>

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:52.180
We're saved...

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.720
You run to the end of the train,

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.260
break the coupling, and activate the breaks.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.910
It's a typical running away flag.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.070
You knew this was going to happen?

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.320
It's the first time I've 
used it this way, though.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.580
<i>I didn't do something to a specific person.</i>

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:12.220
<i>It's a stronger power than 
I've been using so far, huh?</i>

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.960
I understand!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:18.090
So she was an assassin, she was!

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.560
So what do you plan on doing, Souta?

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.190
I guess we have to walk.

00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:13.080
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:14.340
Hakua, huh...

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:17.360
I never would have thought I'd 
be running away with princess.

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:20.930
You didn't forget there was 
another princess here, did you?

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:24.520
When there are two princesses like 
this, one of them's usually a fake...

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:25.460
I'm real!

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:27.090
Or maybe the older sister 
protects the younger,

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:28.430
and then gets captured.

00:23:28.430 --> 00:23:30.680
You're just messing with me, aren't you?

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:31.870
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Flag 9</b>

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Someday, 
it'd be Nice if We Could all Go to a Festival Together Again</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Watch next time!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Haruse Hiroki
